{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1’s persistent firewalld policy: SSH is allowed from any address, TCP/9000 is accepted only from node2 (10.100.131.11), and all other TCP/9000 traffic is explicitly rejected. Verified live behavior, persistence, and recovery after sequential restarts of all three nodes.","actions_performed":["Enabled persistent SSH service access in node1’s public zone.","Added an ordered accept rule for node2 to TCP/9000 and a catch-all rejection rule for TCP/9000.","Verified behavior using a temporary listener, then removed it.","Restarted node1, node2, and node3 individually and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Persistent firewall configuration on node1","command_ids":["cmd-8e0d0f3b64a34c59","cmd-f366a3c5dded4d43"],"summary":"Runtime and permanent firewalld state contain SSH, node2’s source-specific TCP/9000 accept rule, and the source-independent catch-all rejection rule. Compiled nftables chains confirm their ordering."},{"requirement":"SSH allowed from any address","command_ids":["cmd-698e90bc12c74607","cmd-5830ca1f634b40b3","cmd-8f04821772a24052","cmd-90b72dd20d3b4a31"],"summary":"Both node2 and node3 received node1’s OpenSSH banner before and after node1’s restart."},{"requirement":"TCP/9000 allowed only from node2 and rejected from node3/everywhere else","command_ids":["cmd-57c18b9980a448f5","cmd-698e90bc12c74607","cmd-5830ca1f634b40b3","cmd-f366a3c5dded4d43"],"summary":"With a confirmed live listener, node2 received HTTP 200 while node3 received immediate rejection. The final compiled catch-all rule rejects TCP/9000 without a source restriction."},{"requirement":"Node2 allow-rule causality","command_ids":["cmd-af2cf64937db4472","cmd-f02430da8eca4d88","cmd-21d95ed800b84ab2","cmd-f43db23f6ec941b4"],"summary":"Temporarily removing only the runtime node2 exception caused rejection; reloading persistent configuration restored node2 access."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-aae9faa4208442c8","cmd-513de2ae4ac546b8","cmd-dfe1616b732d48b5","cmd-0d8c95e92ce04be9","cmd-8f04821772a24052","cmd-90b72dd20d3b4a31"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from d546da19-398f-473c-b85c-afdd17037523 to 4daaec17-b402-49f6-bc42-4c1a2c96a515. SSH, firewalld, persistent rules, and expected traffic behavior recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-a0ce93350ff14562","cmd-20ee6e17ecbe42e2","cmd-ad9d988219f2476d"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 15443601-befc-4fc4-aa76-b417968ad3f9 to 15c5a0ed-af8f-4bdd-8063-941c9cdca0ad. SSH, root filesystem, and permitted TCP/9000 connectivity recovered."},{"requirement":"Node3 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-cf19dc039e1d4930","cmd-bb546333df134b43","cmd-ff25f3a67bf944eb"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from e65e6bcf-e09d-42b7-8317-cb6310086cb7 to 44d382c8-2dc5-41ea-89a9-f45ecd0d10e4. SSH and root filesystem recovered, while TCP/9000 remained rejected."}]}
